[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448696367","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112039#issuecomment-3448696367","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112039","id":3448696367,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Nju4v","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-26T17:00:00Z","updated_at":"2025-11-02T00:04:46Z","body":"I had some doubts about `member_functions` due to its isolated results being the most mixed.\r\n\r\nI compiled 3 builds using `PATH=/path/to/x86_64-godot-linux-gnu_sdk-buildroot/bin:$PATH scons -j8 target=template_debug dev_build=yes debug_symbols=yes separate_debug_symbols=no optimize=speed_trace` to have some optimizations, as overall `AHashMap` showed to be heavier than `HashMap` at `-Og`.\r\n\r\nI named them:\r\n- **Before** (`master`)\r\n- **After** (PR)\r\n- **Partial** (PR but `member_funcs` changes reverted)\r\n \r\n \r\nThen used `perf` to profile over Bunnymark. All 3 had 1000 bunnies spawn at `_ready()` and quit after 30 seconds.\r\n\r\nFocus on `GDScriptInstance::callp()` as that is what the stress test affects and where code was modified (all `HashMap` operations exposed).\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Before</summary>\r\n<img width=\"984\" height=\"533\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/18a0df51-a177-472a-8911-e6c31e1704c1\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>After</summary>\r\n<img width=\"984\" height=\"559\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b1293ec-0d07-46c1-a663-76c32eb07f66\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Partial</summary>\r\n<img width=\"985\" height=\"585\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a696c678-963c-40f0-822b-3db3dfe61b61\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nThe sum of all `(A)HashMap` operation cycles in the screenshots would be 3.16%, 3.92% and 2.42% respectively. They also showed a FPS of 1200, 1221 and 1202, respectively.\r\n\r\nComparing the last two, it seems to indicate that using `AHashMap` for member functions either isn't optimal, or some bottleneck has been moved out of the way allowing more callbacks (thus causing more cycles but more FPS). The latter seemed to be the case when profiling #106646.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448696367/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3476982821","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112039#issuecomment-3476982821","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112039","id":3476982821,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PPowl","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-02T00:08:35Z","updated_at":"2025-11-02T00:09:14Z","body":"For safety purposes, to make this PR harmless™ like #112129, I reverted the `insert_new` changes to the GDScript compiler.\r\n\r\nProfiling doesn't even show the compiler callbacks, so the improvement should remain the same.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3476982821/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3538924985","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112039#issuecomment-3538924985","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112039","id":3538924985,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7S77W5","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/fo