ble from GDScript. Keep in mind benchmarks tend to fluctuate a lot. A c++ benchmark may shed more light into it. Or someone does more thorough tests to clear this up.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3587553851/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3587574992","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112039#issuecomment-3587574992","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112039","id":3587574992,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7V1gzQ","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-28T00:26:51Z","updated_at":"2025-11-28T00:50:12Z","body":"> Since Holon didn't measure any performance benefits in the same code that you and calinou did, i think more testing is in order.\r\n\r\nApart from feedback on Dictionary, all I've seen was a feedback on my `RBMap` mention.\r\n\r\n> I do think switching to AHashMap can matter, though I'm not sure if it will be benchmarkable from GDScript.\r\n\r\nThis is a GDScript performance PR. Benchmarking from GDScript is a requirement.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3587574992/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3587627666","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112039#issuecomment-3587627666","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112039","id":3587627666,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7V1tqS","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-28T01:09:34Z","updated_at":"2025-11-28T02:28:26Z","body":"~~Ran on Bunnymark once again and updated the results, but this time more details and the Bunnymark project I'm running for them were included.~~\r\n\r\nEdit: those weren't run on `master`, but a lot of commits behind. When actually running on the current `master` the benchmarks showed this PR to actually **slowdown** GDScript.\r\n\r\nOn the other hand, I also measured that this PR may be saved if #113089 is merged first.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3587627666/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3587724591","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112039#issuecomment-3587724591","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112039","id":3587724591,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7V2FUv","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-28T02:29:50Z","updated_at":"2025-11-28T03:23:29Z","body":"This PR turned out to be slower on current `master` than the last commit the benchmark was run.\r\n\r\nBetter wait for #113089 first as that already does a slight FPS increase and by stacking with this one results in even better performance. [Here are the benchmarks](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113089#issuecomment-3587749067).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3587724591/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3589291251","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112039#issuecomment-3589291251","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112039","id":3589291251,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7V8Dzz","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-28T13:08:18Z","updated_at":"2025-11-28T13:08:18Z","body":"> Apart from feedback on Dictionary, all I've seen was a feedback on my `RBMap` mention.\r\n\r\nThe RBMap comment was meant to express something else: For evaluating changes it's important to choose relevant workloads. I'm trying to question whether just throwing Bunnymark on every optimization is a relevant workload. RBMap was the easy to grasp example, but for all I know there might as well be unexpected results when scaling up the member count with `AHashMap`. And I think this kind of testing is important for this specific change.\r\n\r\n> This is a GDScript performance PR. Benchmarking from GDScript is a requirement.\r\n\r\nYour change specifically targets the performance of `get` so I'd say it's absolutely fine to move the callsite to C++ if it helps stabilizing the results.\r\n\r\nSure sanity checking this with a full GDScript pipeline makes sense. But I don't think it's required for providing an initial prove of the concept.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3589291251/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4973550239","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112039#issuecomment-4973550239","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112039","id":4973550239,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKHJanw","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-14T20:12:42Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T14:48:32Z","body":"Rebased on top of `master`.\r\n\r\nAfter a few more benchmarks I've decided to reduce the change to just `GDScript::member_indices`. Somehow, while changing `member_indices` has a notable effect, adding `static_variables_indices` to the mix seems to bottleneck it, even though it's empty.\r\n\r\nTest project: [bunnymark_custom.tar.gz](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30023157/bunnymark_custom.tar.gz), with 10000 bunnies.\r\n\r\n| Run | `master` | PR |\r\n|-|-|-|\r\n| 1 | 163.53 | 178.87 |\r\n| 2 | 162.93 | 178.40 |\r\n| 3 | 162.60 | 180.20 |","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4973550239/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4993053562","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112039#issuecomment-4993053562","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112039","id":4993053562,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKZvzeg","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-16T14:27:42Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T14:27:42Z","body":"This PR does not meet the requirements laid out in our [guidelines for optimization PRs](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/optimization.html#optimization-guidelines). We don't have profiling data that indicates that a real usecase is bottle-necked by this code. Results on the benchmarks have been mixed over the lifetime of the PR and different people running them. Concerns about the benchmarks have also not been addressed, they are not representative or have nothing to do with the change. Due to that I'm not able to determine if this PR is an improvement so I'm going to reject it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4993053562/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]